WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.376
No way I’m not gonna make it.

00:00:01.376 --> 00:00:02.585
Right coach?

00:00:02.585 --> 00:00:03.211
SCREAMING!

00:00:11.344 --> 00:00:13.388
They always told me to follow my dreams.

00:00:14.806 --> 00:00:17.892
Maybe that’s something that they say to a lot of kids.

00:00:20.937 --> 00:00:21.771
Push-Ups.

00:00:21.771 --> 00:00:22.772
I’m too tired.

00:00:22.772 --> 00:00:25.191
You the number one player in the area code.

00:00:25.191 --> 00:00:28.027
What do you think the haters want my baby to be?

00:00:28.027 --> 00:00:29.237
Tired.

00:00:30.655 --> 00:00:32.240
My son needs a coach like you.

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:35.910
And he’ll take your team from good to “Oh my God!”

00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:36.911
I don’t coach high school kids.

00:00:36.911 --> 00:00:38.621
All my kids are 14 youth.

00:00:38.621 --> 00:00:41.166
Jace turned 14 yesterday.

00:00:45.795 --> 00:00:46.629
These programs are where

00:00:46.629 --> 00:00:48.381
the best talent is getting their start.

00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:50.842
These are future NBA stars.

00:00:56.598 --> 00:00:58.141
No way I’m not gonna make it.

00:00:58.141 --> 00:00:59.350
Right coach?

00:01:04.397 --> 00:01:07.400
Guess I’ve been worried that everything 
I want could be slipping away.

00:01:08.401 --> 00:01:10.528
I dropped in the rankings from 1 to 4!

00:01:10.528 --> 00:01:13.156
So clap back on the court. You gotta reclaim that crown.

00:01:13.823 --> 00:01:16.659
Can’t afford to lose, Coach. Not you. Not me.

00:01:16.659 --> 00:01:19.537
Your program is barely holding on financially.

00:01:19.537 --> 00:01:21.831
You gonna screw things up like you always do.

00:01:21.831 --> 00:01:26.795
My father would tell me that I had to learn
what it is to lose before I learn what it is to win.

00:01:27.879 --> 00:01:28.338
Hands up!

00:01:28.338 --> 00:01:29.255
For what?! I didn’t do nothing!

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:30.089
On the ground!

00:01:30.089 --> 00:01:31.883
He is an eighth-grade honor student.

00:01:31.883 --> 00:01:33.426
This feeling you have right now.

00:01:33.426 --> 00:01:35.011
That fire.

00:01:36.805 --> 00:01:38.264
Use it.

00:01:41.559 --> 00:01:43.061
Carry it with you to practice.

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:45.313
Your next game.

00:01:46.523 --> 00:01:47.565
Ohhh!!!

00:01:49.776 --> 00:01:51.152
If we wanna get to nationals,

00:01:51.152 --> 00:01:52.362
we gonna have to win out the tournament.

00:01:52.362 --> 00:01:53.571
No more losses.

00:01:56.241 --> 00:01:58.451
The longer you wait to redeem yourself,

00:02:01.371 --> 00:02:02.747
the harder it becomes.

00:02:06.042 --> 00:02:09.170
Sometimes other things in life
feel more important than basketball.

00:02:09.170 --> 00:02:10.880
Y’all aren’t just my teammates anymore.

00:02:10.880 --> 00:02:11.548
Y’all are my brothers.

00:02:11.548 --> 00:02:12.674
No doubt.

00:02:14.259 --> 00:02:16.928
People are gonna want you to stand for many things.

00:02:16.928 --> 00:02:20.890
More than anything a team stands for each other.

00:02:21.975 --> 00:02:25.019
Win or lose you walk on that court with swagger.

00:02:25.854 --> 00:02:27.480
You walk off with swagger.

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:28.314
SCREAMING!

